; First visit to Edward Castle. Supplements StoryDialogue.patch.asm.
; The two timed Kara greetings use Retranslation wording.
; 04CE45 shares Kara’s plea and skips its opening wait.

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_left_guard'
ec0A_left_guard.dialogstring_04C115! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Soldier: This is King[N]Edward's castle.[WAI][N]If you've come for an[N]audience, state your name.[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will shows the guards[N]King Edward's letter.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Soldier: You're the king's[N]guest? Forgive us. Please[N]enter.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_right_guard'
ec0A_right_guard.dialogstring_04C229! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]This is King Edward's[N]castle. Be courteous, and[N]remember that the king is[N]very strict.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_bed_maid'
ec0A_bed_maid.dialogstring_04C7BF! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]I heard an assassin was[N]hired recently.[WAI][N]I don't know what's[N]happening in this castle[N]anymore[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_caring_maid'
ec0A_caring_maid.dialogstring_04C8FB! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Jeez, he's so shy[AD][WAI][N]Still, I'm just glad to[N]know there's someone[N]somewhere thinking of me.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_prison_guard'
ec0A_prison_guard.dialogstring_04D1BE! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Soldier: This is the[N]underground prison.[N]Ordinary people aren't[N]allowed inside.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_kara_guard'
ec0A_kara_guard.dialogstring_04CAF5! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Your business is finished.[FIN][CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,6][SIZ:8,1][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Get out! Now![FIN][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_kara'
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CC6E! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: Who's that?[PAU:5A][CLD]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CC84! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: Do I have a guest?[END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CC96! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: You[AD] You came[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme0]Will: I was told to bring[N]a Crystal Ring to King[N]Edward, but[AD][END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CCE4! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: He's awful![N]Awful[AD]![WAI][N]My father has been[N]taking things[AD][N]important things![WAI][N]Just because he can[AD][WAI][N]After I escaped to[N]find you, they won't[N]even let me go outside![WAI][N]There's even a rumor[N]that my parents hired[N]an assassin[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme0]Will: Wait, you escaped[N]to see me?[END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CDC0! `[PAU:28][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: I've been having[N]strange dreams lately.[WAI][N]In them, a voice kept[N]telling me I had to[N]find you[AD][WAI][N]That's why I went to[N]South Cape.[WAI][N]I'm scared, Will.[N]Dad and Mom seem like[N]different people now.[WAI][N]I'm begging you, help me.[N]Take me out of here[N]somehow! Please[AD][FIN][CLD][PAU:1E][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Soldier: Your Majesty[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: Please. You're[N]definitely going to come[N]for me, right, Will?[END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CE45! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: I've been having[N]strange dreams lately.[WAI][N]In them, a voice kept[N]telling me I had to[N]find you[AD][WAI][N]That's why I went to[N]South Cape.[WAI][N]I'm scared, Will.[N]Dad and Mom seem like[N]different people now.[WAI][N]I'm begging you, help me.[N]Take me out of here[N]somehow! Please[AD][FIN][CLD][PAU:1E][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@StoryTheme19]Soldier: Your Majesty[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme1]Kara: Please. You're[N]definitely going to come[N]for me, right, Will?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_edward'
ec0A_edward.dialogstring_04C40E! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@StoryTheme4]King Edward: YOU'RE Will?[N]You're dressed rather[N]drab, I'd think.[FIN][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]Well, let's get on with[N]it. Did you bring the[N]Crystal Ring?[WAI][PAL:0][N] Yes[N] No`
ec0A_edward.dialogstring_04C460! `[CLR][PRT:@StoryTheme4]Good. An honest lad.[N]Give me the Ring.[FIN][PRT:@StoryTheme0]Will: [N].............[FIN][PRT:@StoryTheme4]King Edward:[N]Hmm?[PAU:3C][CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,11][SIZ:B,2][PRT:@StoryTheme4]Are you lying[N]to me, young whelp?![FIN]`
ec0A_edward.dialogstring_04C4D5! `[CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,11][SIZ:C,3][PRT:@StoryTheme4]How dare you [N]shamelessly say[N]something like that[AD]!?[FIN]`
ec0A_edward.dialogstring_04C4FB! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@StoryTheme4]I knew you didn't have it![N]Well. Soldiers! Throw him[N]in the prison![FIN]Then go search Will's[N]house for the Crystal[N]Ring![END]`
